    the three-month period ended November&nbsp;30, 2025 amounted to $113,014 (November&nbsp;30, 2024: net finance income of $1,107,118).
    This fluctuation was caused primarily by mark to market valuations of the Company&rsquo;s derivative liabilities at the balance sheet
    date.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right"></P>

